        <RegionalVariationNote>Varies among sub-tribes in name, song style, and duration</RegionalVariationNote>
        <SymbolismNote>Chang Lha – symbol of fertility, abundance, and ancestral blessings</SymbolismNote>
        <TellsStoryOf>Giving thanks for agricultural bounty and sharing prosperity with the community.</TellsStoryOf>
