        <PerformedDuringNote>Clan feasts, victory celebrations, or rites honoring esteemed individuals.</PerformedDuringNote>
        <RegionalVariationNote>Variations in costume, formation, and narration among clans</RegionalVariationNote>
        <SymbolismNote>Honor, bravery, status, and communal pride.</SymbolismNote>
        <TellsStoryOf>Heroic deeds, clan pride, and rites of passage, particularly tied to tribal or warrior achievements.</TellsStoryOf>
        <hasSongNote>Chant-like singing or call-and-response narrations of valor.</hasSongNote>
        <schema:description>A ceremonial martial dance performed to celebrate significant events such as victories, honors, or tribal gatherings.</schema:description>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


