        <FormationNote>Rows or circular patterns, often performed in unison.</FormationNote>
        <HistoricalOriginNote>Rooted in the lawm institution, which served as a traditional youth training and social system</HistoricalOriginNote>
        <MinCount rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">6</MinCount>
