        <FoodPracticeNote>Five or more pigs cooked and feasted along with zu</FoodPracticeNote>
        <HistoricalOriginNote>rooted in traditional dormitory (Som) systems</HistoricalOriginNote>
        <ParticipantsNote>Young men and women, though traditionally male-dominated</ParticipantsNote>
        <RegionalVariationNote>Minor variations in dance and song styles across clans and villages</RegionalVariationNote>
        <SymbolismNote>Valor, communal identity, and intergenerational continuity</SymbolismNote>
        <TellsStoryOf>Merit and prestige earned through hunting achievements.</TellsStoryOf>
        <hasSongNote>Heroic and hunting chants (oral tradition) praising ancestral deeds and individual valor</hasSongNote>
